OL,3,ABurnham cancels engagements after death
OL,4,Aof father
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fcancelled official engagements on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday following the death
OL,9,Fof his father Roy, who had Alzheimer's.
OL,11,FHe had been due to host a meeting of
OL,12,Fbusiness leaders in Downing Street on
OL,13,FMonday, and was expected to speak at
OL,14,Fthe annual trade union TUC Congress in
OL,15,FBrighton on Tuesday.
OL,17,FIn July, Burnham spoke about his
OL,18,Ffather's condition and said it had
OL,19,Finfluenced his drive to reform adult
OL,20,Fsocial care in England.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
