OL,3,ARussia hits Ukrainian train shortly
OL,4,Aafter Boris Johnson and top European
OL,5,Aofficials leave station
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohnson and other European national
OL,8,Fsecurity advisers, including the UK's
OL,9,FJonathan Powell, had passed along the
OL,10,Fsame line on a different train on their
OL,11,Fway back from a conference in Kyiv.
OL,13,FRussia's defence ministry said it had
OL,14,Fstruck "railway infrastructure" in
OL,15,Fwestern Ukraine, but Ukraine's state
OL,16,Frailway company Ukrzaliznytsia said the
OL,17,Fdrone's target "could have been the
OL,18,Fdiplomatic train".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
